.el .ds Aq '
.TH crisk-collect 1  "collect 0.1.0" 
.SH NAME
crisk\-collect \- Collect the facts of one change: paths from git, map and policy from the base revision, declarations and label events from the forge, labels from signal files
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcrisk collect\fR [\fB\-\-github\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-pr\fR] [\fB\-\-gitlab\fR] [\fB\-\-mr\fR] [\fB\-\-gitlab\-url\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-pages\fR] [\fB\-\-base\fR] [\fB\-\-head\fR] [\fB\-\-checkout\fR] [\fB\-\-declarations\fR] [\fB\-\-signal\fR] [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Collect the facts of one change: paths from git, map and policy from the base revision, declarations and label events from the forge, labels from signal files
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-github\fR \fI<OWNER/REPO>\fR
Read the change from this GitHub repository (OWNER/REPO); requires \-\-pr
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress status lines on stderr
.TP
\fB\-\-pr\fR \fI<N>\fR
The pull request number
.TP
\fB\-\-gitlab\fR \fI<GROUP/PROJECT>\fR
Read the change from this GitLab project (GROUP/PROJECT); requires \-\-mr
.TP
\fB\-\-mr\fR \fI<N>\fR
The merge request IID
.TP
\fB\-\-gitlab\-url\fR \fI<URL>\fR [default: https://gitlab.com/api/v4]
The GitLab API base URL (https only)
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-pages\fR \fI<N>\fR [default: 100]
Maximum pages per list endpoint (1..=1000)
.TP
\fB\-\-base\fR \fI<REV>\fR
The target branch commit the map and policy are read from (default: the forge change\*(Aqs base)
.TP
\fB\-\-head\fR \fI<REV>\fR
The change\*(Aqs head (default: the forge change\*(Aqs head, else HEAD)
.TP
\fB\-\-checkout\fR \fI<DIR>\fR [default: .]
The local clone
.TP
\fB\-\-declarations\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Declarations from a YAML file instead of the change\*(Aqs description
.TP
\fB\-\-signal\fR \fI<KIND=PATH>\fR
A signal file: sarif=PATH, privacy\-datamap=PATH or acc=PATH (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Write the facts to FILE instead of stdout
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0
